=== CN121006697.A ===
{
  "abstract": "The invention discloses an MXene/elastic bandage and a high-linearity strain sensor based on the MXene/elastic bandage. The preparation method of the MXene/elastic bandage comprises the following steps: fixing the elastic bandage on a stretching die, and carrying out pre-stretching treatment on the elastic bandage; the pre-stretched elastic bandage is soaked in a CTAB solution, and treatment is conducted for 25 min to 35 min; the obtained CTAB elastic bandage is soaked in an MXene colloidal solution, MXene is fully adsorbed, drying is carried out, prestress is released, natural retraction is carried out, and the MXene/elastic bandage is obtained. The two ends of the MXene/elastic bandage are further coated with conductive silver paste, after thermocuring treatment, the sensing area is soaked in a PDMS mixed solution, thermocuring treatment and packaging are conducted, and the high-linearity strain sensor based on the MXene/elastic bandage is obtained. The breathable and comfortable garment is good in breathability and wearing comfort, light in weight, compact in structure, capable of being flexibly attached to the human body and suitable for being worn for a long time.",
  "docId": "CN121006697.A",
  "lang": "en"
}

